# Wave W17-Y (Route 214): meteor post — a fallen-shard marker post toward the Shardfall end: a weathered post carrying one small purple meteor shard at its head, marking where the crater field begins beyond the fence (design: the design’s crater field and its fallen purple shards at the road’s north end — the field itself is beyond the fence, the posts stand on the road). On verge turf (fully opaque, ground baked in) — split from Route 215’s shard posts ahead by the single head shard entire: these mark a beginning, those mark a fall zone.
